    "body_html": "<p><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMNbweTjWPFyYB0Wp0-3kb5dE0kGjNkfIzCq9VGdTHpbmiorCJr0RIg5zrButa_PognHlaUpWcZtWytbDXUfAxkhuFwwg_bSb2hR4lunWC02Xbm_Y5p1eropeBYEk6wGHx4tpAcoZa1HuE5ZUCylUCQ=w1600-h1600-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNU7fUi1fT0uaHIfXe-4IWQa0CETHEeAaG2xtWb3hht6patlVDQa0H3SCmXmm4pU8331FSfQWOy4__861xo0FcGKJbYsSpPvOdiU8R_rjeq0yu3gNJcFdFfp3wiND226gtFlZAgdBUrH0-CwekqmrD_=w1600-h1600-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPzkmSoY1ulRkRglUhlZz9SEHSv5yZaRVhNLDgS1apLDNt1rVeNI5bI6ybmau9ruq3qeWPHboxs5QrYKszKNgt2ShAkt-G3OtJTnPfDZk_d3rceAfoBYABRubUOxAtwBr-mu0U-R7abwMgRre2o4sgi=w1600-h1600-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNeyWHlt_aUlP9ZPQeL0lgX0GNv76Enot_8cTy8utU71ylZiPHv4vc2RVNjeBWyRmNy8EJBDhEsg-iln1rI1O3aEOQe_6VkK985ZgD-hEk1YcJWjPOcJMIsUOc6e1F_Y011A42-gfQHPPA0UT29v_8N=w1600-h1600-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOSRdS6aZ2iQ_ll3xolrHeE65GRDLNxtMEkuRtYxPDPuFqjdugimFMtPfpEpWAkFz4bBr72VxNfJVlzX7c7xk7dV5droaJoY5yG_G9V91ON2Ro9pckLtxwNzO-NM4yHBDFzf6eEJSAEEmlXzcYE7vaI=w1600-h1600-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNmbeoQ--5-Za0P0EKtYznkomC65kjJpAgdXrZ-o9cj0OuTZl6lk-KdKqjKX1t7BSamSIHSi2JWSQUfCI2wkf_Hk1NCmAMiuLGJ9fu1rlT3o7kqaJco6Edd6KfFR15YWcHHbGASi1iypf9LDdTbkpv-=w1600-h1600-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNYBy5FLoKgzk1BnUttf0TY0IybhY2Oah_QxM6meZaWWQTrr5X0x2XEvwblMARQnIYyQSM7lKKs6plQN6LoE8UQpJiVBWys0fj83Sc1wxO6pg1AMPrUzPkCrmJJ_Y6cZhPIu9c5rOrzTl2cTDRuLYgf=w1600-h1600-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMRaapVnPDLdyZtWDAHzFA-G-AKplm16sjCXb6G01VVlmALg0YIHWG9f9-urKWEp6VO_DHY-eu0bwbgD0-AXY-pdxIpb1NCoO9zsxFh4Hm_KLc8WfRDbcYEr7NO4-7zu6e4SunpYh9yoeKS-rOt0gu7=w1500-h1500-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczN6MocKo5AEUOXe5iu-02QuOwoOUrZ3qij_2nsA0vNpAZH-2gdx2GfGITY-I2s6IyDYAhdlF1QOcWsAUH3cxcf7yD26j6jz0FGXSrkxwl4O7FHKfXRajerW-mGx4V0sCEQElM0FyzH-94o_SY3kDVmS=w1600-h1600-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"></p>\n<!-- \ud83d\udd25 SkullSaints Handheld (A523) | Card-style Spec Sheet for Shopify -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 20px; border-radius: 14px; background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); font-family: 'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #111827;\">\ud83d\udd25 Trimui Smart Pro S</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0; color: #6b7280;\">Allwinner A523 \u2022 Mali-G57MC1 \u2022 4.96\" IPS Touch \u2022 5000mAh \u2022 Trimui UI</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr)); gap: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #111827; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Colors</strong><br>Black / White / Gray / Red / Yellow / Green</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Processor (CPU)</strong><br>Allwinner A523 \u2014 2.0 GHz</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #fb923c; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Graphics (GPU)</strong><br>Arm Mali\u2011G57MC1 \u2014 744 MHz</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f97316; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Memory (DRAM)</strong><br>1 GB LPDDR4</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0ea5e9; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Storage</strong><br>8 GB eMMC (built\u2011in)<br>Expandable via TF card up to 1 TB<br>USB supports FAT32 flash drives</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Display &amp; Touch</strong><br>4.96\" IPS, 720 \u00d7 1280, fully laminated<br>10\u2011point capacitive touch</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #14b8a6; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Wireless</strong><br>WLAN 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac/ax (2.4 &amp; 5 GHz)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Bluetooth</strong><br>BT 5.4</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Audio</strong><br>Built\u2011in stereo speakers (1 W \u00d7 2)<br>3.5 mm headphone jack</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #84cc16; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Microphone</strong><br>Built\u2011in mono microphone</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #facc15; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Battery</strong><br>5000 mAh Li\u2011polymer, 3.7 V \u2014 up to 6 hours</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Charging</strong><br>USB Type\u2011C, 5V/2A \u2014 charges while off<br>USB data transfer limited to 500 mA</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #eab308; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>LEDs</strong><br>Middle LOGO charging indicator<br>RGB dual\u2011joystick ambient light</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #c084fc; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Controls</strong><br>DPAD, A/B/X/Y, Select/Start, Menu/Home<br>L1/L2/R1/R2, L3/R3 (joysticks), Custom FN</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #a855f7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Other Keys</strong><br>Power \u2022 Volume\u2011 \u2022 Volume+ \u2022 Custom FN \u2022 DIP switch</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Sockets</strong><br>Top Type\u2011C: USB Host<br>Bottom Type\u2011C: Charging + OTG<br>TF card slot</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #059669; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Haptics</strong><br>Single\u2011channel vibration motor</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0ea5e9; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Joystick</strong><br>TMR joystick</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #06b6d4; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>System</strong><br>Linux \u2014 Trimui UI</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0ea5a4; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Languages</strong><br>EN / DE / ES / FR / IT / ZH / JA / KO / PT / RU / VI</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #94a3b8; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Material</strong><br>ABS plastic + glass + electronic components</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #64748b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Dimensions (mm)</strong><br>Width: 187.4 \u00d7 Height: 79.8 \u00d7 Depth: 17.2</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #334155; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Net Weight</strong><br>256 g</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Reason to Buy</strong><br><span style=\"color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;\">Portable gaming \u2022 True RGB ambience \u2022 Long battery life</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13px; text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 20px;\">Specifications may vary by configuration and region.</p>\n</div>",
